# Firebase migration backend infra (Cloud Functions, the Sheets->Firestore
# mirror script, and the Firebase CLI's own local hosting cache) lives on
# the firebase-migration branch, not main -- main is the static-site-only
# branch GitHub Pages actually serves, and never merges the full Firebase
# migration history, only cherry-picked "cutover" pieces. Ignored here so
# a local `npm install`/`firebase` CLI run in either directory (or the
# CLI's own cache) doesn't show up as untracked noise on this branch.
node_modules/
.firebase/
functions/
tools/
*-service-account*.json
*-sa-key*.json
firebase-debug*.log
